    {"text": "A mounting, restless impatience rose with every minute.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "His violent, hair-trigger temper boiled over.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "She seethed in silence all the way home.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "He bristled at the remark.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "She exploded with fury.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Helpless, choking frustration tightened her throat.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A deep, burning hatred smouldered for years.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A hot wave of indignation swept over him.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Anger churned in his stomach.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He nursed a grudge as other men nurse a drink.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
