    {"text": "After a short, noisy tantrum, the toddler forgot what the trouble had been.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "He raged like a caged bear.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Her temper erupted, and the whole kitchen heard it.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "His spite festered in the dark, where no one could see it.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Her anger was the quiet kind, and far more frightening.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
